---
description: Sanity schema, GROQ, and talk-vs-event IA
globs: apps/studio/**,apps/web/src/lib/sanity/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Guide: `docs/sanity-guide.md`. Workflow: `.cursor/skills/sanity-content/SKILL.md`. Prefer the Sanity MCP over guessing.

- Talk = timeless bookable topic. Event = dated appearance (usually references a talk). Do not model an upcoming gig as a talk.
- New schema fields must be added to the matching projection in `apps/web/src/lib/sanity/queries.ts` or they never appear on the site.
- Every list fetch is failure-tolerant (`sanityFetch(...).catch(() => [])` or a fallback object). Empty CMS is an empty state, not a 500.
- Country names on events: standard English (`Czechia`). They drive flag emojis.
- Do not bake editorial copy into components when it belongs in Studio.
